Subject: [PATCH] feat: return the Codex turn diff on the prompt response

Clients that opt in with clientCapabilities._meta.codex.turnDiff get the
final turn/diff/updated payload of a completed turn in the session/prompt
response _meta.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
